Show senders waiting for a decision (default if no subcommand): the ones the Screener count counts, first seen in the last 14 days

Usage: mxr screener queue [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>  [default: 100]
      --all-senders    Every sender without a decision, in any folder, however old
  -h, --help           Print help
